OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for violence at Henry
OL,4,ANowak protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was part of a mob that
OL,7,Fattacked police officers following a
OL,8,Fmurder trial has been handed a two-year
OL,9,Fjail sentence.
OL,11,FPeter Black, 46, pleaded guilty at
OL,12,FSouthampton Crown Court to violent
OL,13,Fdisorder in the city on 2 June.
OL,15,FHe is the 34th person to be charged
OL,16,Fover the night of violence, which
OL,17,Ffollowed the sentencing of Vickrum
OL,18,FDigwa for murdering student Henry
OL,19,FNowak.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
