OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for violence at Henry
OL,4,ANowak protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard Black, of Waterhouse
OL,7,FLane, Southampton, had 26 previous
OL,8,Fconvictions for 141 offences and was
OL,9,Fpreviously jailed for ordering a
OL,10,Fsemi-automatic handgun on the dark web.
